  m_Name: ArrowAstral
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: Astral
  _description: Terafine expels the target into the astral, depriving it of the ability
    to use physical attacks. The speed of movement in the astral drops by 50%, the
    magic damage received increases by 10%. While in the astral, the target does
    not receive physical damage, and magic damage increases by 10%. Natural regeneration
    in the astral causes damage. The elf can transfer herself to the astral, receiving
    the same effects. The time spent in the Astral is 4 seconds  "Run if you can.
    In the astral you are only a shadow, and magic will be your undoing - Terafine"
  _icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75313173717aca84aa7a265b4075c961, type: 3}
